╭─ Issue description ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Issue Title: [Bug]: Agent middleware next_handler resets upstream kwargs when inner middleware omits or partially forwards kwargs               │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Description:                                                                                                                                    │
│ ### Prerequisites                                                                                                                               │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ -  I have searched the existing (https://github.com/agentscope-ai/agentscope/issues) and                                                        │
│ (https://github.com/agentscope-ai/agentscope/discussions), and this is not a duplicate.                                                         │
│ -  This is a bug, not a usage question. (For questions, please use                                                                              │
│ [Discussions](https://github.com/agentscope-ai/agentscope/discussions/new?category=general) instead.)                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Background / Description                                                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ I was trying to compose multiple agent middlewares in the documented onion style.                                                               │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ When an outer middleware modifies `input_kwargs` and forwards the modified input via `next_handler(...)`, a later transparent middleware may    │
│ reasonably call `next_handler()` without passing kwargs. In that case, I expected the current modified middleware input to continue flowing     │
│ inward.                                                                                                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Instead, the recursive `execute_chain` falls back to the original default arguments captured when the chain was created. This silently discards │
│ prior middleware modifications.                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ This affects agent-side onion hooks such as:                                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ - `on_reply`                                                                                                                                    │
│ - `on_reasoning`                                                                                                                                │
│ - `on_acting`                                                                                                                                   │
│ - `on_model_call`                                                                                                                               │
│ - `on_compress_context`                                                                                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Example failure mode:                                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ 1. Middleware A changes the user input from `"original"` to `"modified"` and calls `next_handler(inputs=modified)`.                             │
│ 2. Middleware B receives `"modified"` in `input_kwargs`.                                                                                        │
│ 3. Middleware B is transparent and calls `next_handler()`.                                                                                      │
│ 4. The underlying agent/model receives `"original"` again.                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Error Messages                                                                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ```shell                                                                                                                                        │
│ There is no exception or stack trace. The issue is silent behavioral corruption.                                                                │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ### Steps to Reproduce                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ```python                                                                                                                                       │
│ import asyncio                                                                                                                                  │
│ import sys                                                                                                                                      │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ sys.path.insert(0, "src")                                                                                                                       │
│ sys.path.insert(0, "tests")                                                                                                                     │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ from utils import MockModel                                                                                                                     │
│ from agentscope.agent import Agent                                                                                                              │
│ from agentscope.middleware import MiddlewareBase                                                                                                │
│ from agentscope.message import UserMsg, TextBlock                                                                                               │
│ from agentscope.model import ChatResponse                                                                                                       │
│ from agentscope.tool import Toolkit                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ received_messages = []                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ class TrackingModel(MockModel):                                                                                                                 │
│     async def _call_api(self, *args, **kwargs):                                                                                                 │
│         received_messages.extend(kwargs.get("messages", []))                                                                                    │
│         return await super()._call_api(*args, **kwargs)                                                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ class OuterModifyMiddleware(MiddlewareBase):                                                                                                    │
│     async def on_reply(self, agent, input_kwargs, next_handler):                                                                                │
│         modified = UserMsg("user", "MODIFIED")                                                                                                  │
│         async for item in next_handler(inputs=modified):                                                                                        │
│             yield item                                                                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
